  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1139
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你只匆忙扫了一眼这嵌在翠绿色山林间闪烁着玄紫色光芒的封印大阵，未发现有何变化后便驱动灵舟匆忙而去。
